{"seq":2,"slug":"content-recommendation","title":"内容推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-recommendation-systems/rec-applications/content-recommendation","wordCount":1258,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"内容推荐\">内容推荐</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内容推荐（Content Recommendation）是推荐系统在新闻、视频、短视频、音乐和文章等内容平台上的核心应用。与电商推荐以转化为核心目标不同，内容推荐更关注用户的参与度（Engagement）和满意度（Satisfaction），需要在用户沉浸体验和信息质量之间寻求平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 内容推荐生态&#10;        CREATOR[创作者] --&gt; CONTENT[内容池]&#10;        CONTENT --&gt; REC[推荐系统]&#10;        REC --&gt; USER_C[用户]&#10;        USER_C --&gt; FEEDBACK[行为反馈]&#10;        FEEDBACK --&gt; REC&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 推荐维度&#10;        REC --&gt; INTEREST[兴趣匹配]&#10;        REC --&gt; QUALITY[质量过滤]&#10;        REC --&gt; DIVERSITY[多样性]&#10;        REC --&gt; FRESH[时效性]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 内容推荐生态\n        CREATOR[创作者] --&gt; CONTENT[内容池]\n        CONTENT --&gt; REC[推荐系统]\n        REC --&gt; USER_C[用户]\n        USER_C --&gt; FEEDBACK[行为反馈]\n        FEEDBACK --&gt; REC\n    end\n    subgraph 推荐维度\n        REC --&gt; INTEREST[兴趣匹配]\n        REC --&gt; QUALITY[质量过滤]\n        REC --&gt; DIVERSITY[多样性]\n        REC --&gt; FRESH[时效性]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类型</th>\n<th>消费模式</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>特殊挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短视频</td>\n<td>沉浸式滑动</td>\n<td>完播率、时长</td>\n<td>茧房效应严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长视频</td>\n<td>搜索+浏览</td>\n<td>播放率、完播</td>\n<td>内容理解难度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新闻资讯</td>\n<td>信息流</td>\n<td>CTR、阅读深度</td>\n<td>时效性要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音乐</td>\n<td>随机/歌单</td>\n<td>播放完成率、跳过率</td>\n<td>情境感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文章/博客</td>\n<td>搜索+推荐</td>\n<td>阅读时长</td>\n<td>内容质量评估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内容理解与标签体系\">内容理解与标签体系</h2><p>内容推荐的基础是对内容的深度理解。需要从多模态数据（文本、图片、视频、音频）中提取语义信息，并构建结构化的标签体系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ContentUnderstanding {&#10;  contentId: string;&#10;  textFeatures: TextFeatures;&#10;  visualFeatures: VisualFeatures;&#10;  audioFeatures?: AudioFeatures;&#10;  tags: ContentTag[];&#10;  quality: QualityScore;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TextFeatures {&#10;  title: string;&#10;  titleEmbedding: Float32Array;&#10;  keywords: string[];&#10;  categories: string[];&#10;  sentiment: number;&#10;  readability: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ContentTag {&#10;  tag: string;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;  source: &#39;model&#39; | &#39;manual&#39; | &#39;user&#39;;&#10;  level: &#39;l1&#39; | &#39;l2&#39; | &#39;l3&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QualityScore {&#10;  overall: number;&#10;  originality: number;&#10;  informativeness: number;&#10;  production: number;&#10;  clickbait: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function contentQualityFilter(content: ContentUnderstanding, thresholds: QualityThresholds): boolean {&#10;  if (content.quality.clickbait &gt; thresholds.maxClickbait) return false;&#10;  if (content.quality.overall &lt; thresholds.minOverall) return false;&#10;  if (content.quality.originality &lt; thresholds.minOriginality) return false;&#10;  return true;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentUnderstanding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  contentId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  visualFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VisualFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  audioFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quality</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QualityScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  titleEmbedding</span><span styl